SUMMARY:Wilderness Union Adventure Trivia
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n**This event is open to all - you'll just need to register for this event [our website](https://www.wildernessunion.com/landing/adventure-trivia) to confirm your place.**\n\nWe've teamed up with the legendary Quizmaster Jess team and MEC to bring you a night dedicated entirely to the backcountry. Expect a room full of people who would rather be in a tent than a cubicle\, battling it out over survival stories\, epic expeditions\, and gear knowledge.\n\n**Why You Should Be There:**\n**\\- The Prize\\.** We've got 3 prize packs of **premium outdoor gear worth over $400** to give away courtesy of MEC.\n**\\- The Community\\.** You'll get to meet a crew who have big plans to explore this summer.\n**\\- The Hosting\\.** Analisa from the Quizmaster Jess team is at the helm\, bringing seven years of expertise to ensure the night is filled with banter\, curveballs\, and great energy.\n\n**What to Expect**\n**High-Stakes Competition.** Multiple rounds of nature-adjacent trivia spanning roughly two hours of gameplay.\n**Solo-Friendly Setup.** We specialize in matching solo adventurers with friendly teams because the best stories usually start with meeting a stranger.\n‍**Great Food and Drinks.** Saint John’s Tavern offers a full pub menu and a wide selection of drinks available at your table throughout the entire evening.\n\n**Highlights**\nMEC Prizes. Quizmaster Jess Team. Meet the Crew.\n\n**Event cost: from $9 + HST**\n**Register [here.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/landing/adventure-trivia)**\n\n**About Wilderness Union**\nWilderness Union is deliberate about building an outdoors community that connects you to the life-changing magic of the outdoors and helps you find your people.\n\nMembers range from 20-40 years old. The group is a mix of GTA locals and newcomers to Toronto from within Canada and abroad.\n\nAttendance numbers on Meetup don't reflect our actual event attendance - we typically have 15-20 community members at each event. Large enough that there's someone new to meet but small enough that it's not overwhelming!\n\n***Learn more at our website [www.wildernessunion.com](https://www.wildernessunion.com/)***
